* Patients had achieved HBV DNA\<15 IU/ml、HBeAg\<100 PEIU/ml、HBsAg positive and HBsAg\<1500 IU/ml on treatment of Nucleoside (acid) Analogues (including LAM, ADV, ETV, and TDF )

